### 5. Island Spacing ($\ge 100\text{m}$ Ocean Gap)
- Updated [`ISLAND_CENTERS`](file:///c:/Users/Bob/Documents/github/ATS/island_gen.py#L44-L52) across all 6 procedural biomes to guarantee a minimum ocean gap $>100\text{m}$ (center distances $\ge 206.2\text{m}$) preventing bots from accidentally walking between islands.

