### 6. Fixed Cheap Island Discovery Glitch
- **Bug**: On episode spawn, taking a step on the starting island (Island 0: Lush Grassland) was treated as discovering a new island because `discovered_islands` was empty on reset, instantly giving +50 free reward points and unfairly boosting score grades to "MID" or "GOOD".
- **Fix**:
  - Pre-registered starting island 0 in `rewards.discovered_islands` upon environment initialization and `reset()` in [`ats_env.py`](file:///c:/Users/Bob/Documents/github/ATS/ats_env.py#L25-L65).
  - Restricted `on_island_discovery` in [`rewards.py`](file:///c:/Users/Bob/Documents/github/ATS/rewards.py#L190-L205) and [`ats_env.py`](file:///c:/Users/Bob/Documents/github/ATS/ats_env.py#L160-L170) to only trigger for `island_id > 0` and unvisited islands.

